  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.35 with immutable ProGPU preview.39; selects alpha-capable X11/XWayland visuals for transparent windows; maps ShowActivated=false windows without stealing focus; stabilizes transient ComboBox and menu placement; stops static-frame GPU rendering and bounds retained render-resource caches; consumes the typed, reflection-free ProGPU media drawing-state bridge; and retains native Cocoa popups, Windows OLE clipboard, seven-theme, WPFGallery, and SharpDevelop designer acceptance gates.",
